  "scope": [
    "Hand-authored small snapshots and cutoff-scoped, upstream-verified semantic summaries.",
    "Every supplied intent/outcome/resolved/card summary is already reduced to the same cutoff; filtering preparationSeq here does not validate the timing of its source records or exclude later sub-records from a real journal.",
    "Two-cell examples are not legal complete production map snapshots.",
    "saved_material means upstream has already validated and derived the face; no raw entropy decoding is performed here.",
    "cutoffSeq is a symbolic fixture boundary; production query additionally carries the verified cutoff entryHash.",
    "No natural simulation, journal/hash/transition verification, causal edges, Unity, or measured player data.",
    "Expected column values are manually specified; reversing input collection order must not change the projection."
